\section{Project Name}

A \textbf{powerful} tool for data processing.

\subsection{Installation}

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\ExtensionTok{pip}\NormalTok{ install project{-}name}
\end{Highlighting}
\end{Shaded}

\subsection{Usage}

Import and use the \texttt{process} function:

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\ImportTok{from}\NormalTok{ project }\ImportTok{import}\NormalTok{ process}
\NormalTok{result }\OperatorTok{=}\NormalTok{ process(data)}
\end{Highlighting}
\end{Shaded}

